1440  FOR I = 1 TO OG: PRINT LO%(I): PRINT SO%(I): PRINT VO%(I): POKE M1,0: NEXT : REM CO,MO NON CAMBIANO
1450  FOR I = 1 TO NR: PRINT PT%(I): POKE M1,0: NEXT 
1460  FOR I = 1 TO 20: PRINT F(I): POKE M1,0: NEXT 
